Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:08.66,Chinese,C05-07-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}三月五日的同一暂停点，实际平分后，原主军是三千三百三十七人、满员三千三百七十一；
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:08.66,English,C05-07-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}At the same paused point on March 5, the split left the main army with 3,337 soldiers out of 3,371.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:13.30,Chinese,C05-07-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}新分队三千三百四十二、满员三千三百七十六。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.93,0:00:13.30,English,C05-07-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The new detachment had 3,342 out of 3,376.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:21.26,Chinese,C05-07-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}合计仍六千六百七十九，满员六千七百四十七；完整二十七个兵团各归其位，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:21.26,English,C05-07-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Together they still had 6,679 soldiers out of 6,747, with all 27 regiments accounted for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.10,Chinese,C05-07-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}没有因为平分丢失。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.10,English,C05-07-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}No regiment was lost in the split.
